{
 "slug": "shapes",
 "title": "平面圖形和立體形體",
 "seo_title": "二年級數學 圖形 練習題｜三角形四邊形・正方體長方體・邊長 學習單（附解答）",
 "short_title": "平面圖形和立體",
 "domain": "空間與形狀",
 "standard_code": "S-2-2",
 "standard_url": "https://www.naer.edu.tw/upload/1/16/doc/815/十二年國民基本教育課程綱要國民中小學暨普通型高級中等學校-數學領域.pdf",
 "standard_text": "簡單幾何形體：以操作活動為主。包含平面圖形與立體形體。辨認與認識三角形、四邊形、圓形、正方體、長方體、圓柱體、球體。",
 "meta_desc": "國小二年級數學「平面圖形和立體形體」免費學習單：認識三角形、四邊形、圓形，數邊和頂點，認識正方體、長方體、圓柱、球，長方形邊長和邊長合起來。100題線上練習，圖多，附可列印解答。",
 "key_big": "三角形 3 條邊，四邊形 4 條邊",
 "key_sub": "圖形轉了方向名字不變；正方體、長方體都有 6 個面。",
 "body_html": "<h2>怎麼想</h2><p><b>三角形</b>：3 條直直的邊、3 個頂點；<b>四邊形</b>：4 條邊、4 個頂點；<b>圓形</b>沒有邊和頂點。圖形歪了或轉了方向，名字不會變。</p><p>立體：<div class='qfig'><svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 310 128' width='310' height='128' role='img' aria-label='立體'><g font-family='Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif'><rect x='27.2' y='39.2' width='41.6' height='41.6' fill='#f4d03f' stroke='#a57c00' stroke-width='2'/><polygon points='27.2,39.2 43.2,23.2 84.8,23.2 68.8,39.2' fill='#ffffff' fill-opacity='0.45' stroke='#a57c00' stroke-width='2'/><polygon points='68.8,39.2 84.8,23.2 84.8,64.8 68.8,80.8' fill='#f4d03f' stroke='#a57c00' stroke-width='2'/><polygon points='68.8,39.2 84.8,23.2 84.8,64.8 68.8,80.8' fill='#000000' fill-opacity='0.18'/><polygon points='27.2,39.2 43.2,23.2 84.8,23.2 68.8,39.2' fill='#f4d03f' fill-opacity='0.6' stroke='#a57c00' stroke-width='2'/><text x='56.0' y='118.0' font-size='16' font-weight='700' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>正方體</text><path d='M135.2 24.8 L135.2 79.2 A20.8 9.6 0 0 0 176.8 79.2 L176.8 24.8 Z' fill='#3498db' stroke='#1f5f8b' stroke-width='2'/><ellipse cx='156.0' cy='24.8' rx='20.8' ry='9.6' fill='#ffffff' fill-opacity='0.5' stroke='#1f5f8b' stroke-width='2'/><ellipse cx='156.0' cy='24.8' rx='20.8' ry='9.6' fill='#3498db' fill-opacity='0.6' stroke='#1f5f8b' stroke-width='2'/><text x='156.0' y='118.0' font-size='16' font-weight='700' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>圓柱</text><circle cx='256.0' cy='52.0' r='32.0' fill='#e74c3c' stroke='#922b21' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M224.0 52.0 A32.0 9.6 0 0 0 288.0 52.0' fill='none' stroke='#922b21' stroke-width='1.4'/><path d='M224.0 52.0 A32.0 9.6 0 0 1 288.0 52.0' fill='none' stroke='#922b21' stroke-width='1.2' stroke-dasharray='4 3'/><ellipse cx='244.8' cy='39.2' rx='7.0' ry='4.5' fill='#ffffff' opacity='0.45'/><text x='256.0' y='118.0' font-size='16' font-weight='700' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>球</text></g></svg></div>還有<b>長方體</b>（像面紙盒）。正方體、長方體都有 6 個面。</p><p>把圖形每條邊的長度加起來，就是繞圖形一圈的長度（三年級叫周長）。</p><div class='sn-ex'><span class='sn-ex-t'>例題</span><p class='sn-ex-q'>三條邊 5、6、7 公分的三角形</p><p class='sn-ex-s'>5 ＋ 6 ＋ 7。</p><p class='sn-ex-a'>答：18 公分</p></div><div class='sn-ex'><span class='sn-ex-t'>例題</span><p class='sn-ex-q'>長 8、寬 3 的長方形</p><p class='sn-ex-s'>8 ＋ 3 ＋ 8 ＋ 3。</p><p class='sn-ex-a'>答：22 公分</p></div><h2>常見錯誤</h2><div class='sn-tw'><table class='sn-table'><thead><tr><th>常見錯誤</th><th>正確的想法</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>轉了方向的正方形不是正方形</td><td>轉方向形狀不變</td></tr><tr><td>有彎邊的也是三角形</td><td>三角形的邊都是直的</td></tr><tr><td>長方形只加兩條邊</td><td>4 條邊都要加</td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
